WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.839
Operation Lighthouse

2
00:00:11.873 --> 00:00:14.152
re the unsolved murder
of Gail Vella

3
00:00:14.186 --> 00:00:17.017
on September 10th. 2019.

4
00:00:18.363 --> 00:00:22.574
The name we've been given
is Ross Turner.

5
00:00:22.608 --> 00:00:24.300
Enter the property.

6
00:00:26.923 --> 00:00:29.443
<i>Five Three.
DP for custody transfer.</i>

7
00:00:29.477 --> 00:00:31.341
<i>bringing suspect out now.</i>

8
00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:34.413
Interview of Terry Boyle

9
00:00:34.448 --> 00:00:36.691
by Detective Chief
Inspector Davidson.

10
00:00:36.726 --> 00:00:39.246
Mr Boyle.
did you shoot Gail Vella?

11
00:00:44.734 --> 00:00:46.367
- Did anyone see that?
- Armed police!

12
00:00:46.391 --> 00:00:47.831
Drop your weapons!
Drop your weapons!

13
00:00:51.844 --> 00:00:53.846
A significant number
of other fingerprints

14
00:00:53.881 --> 00:00:55.848
match an individual identified

15
00:00:55.883 --> 00:00:57.885
by the Police National Computer

16
00:00:57.919 --> 00:00:59.197
as Carl Banks.

17
00:00:59.231 --> 00:01:01.313
Carl Banks has an
extensive history of violence.

18
00:01:01.337 --> 00:01:02.579
including firearms offences.

19
00:01:05.513 --> 00:01:07.343
<i>The person who made me see that</i>

20
00:01:07.377 --> 00:01:09.828
<i>there was another way. to be
a useful member of society.</i>

21
00:01:09.862 --> 00:01:12.693
<i>was a police officer.
He's the reason why</i>

22
00:01:12.727 --> 00:01:15.385
<i>I wanted to become
a police officer too.</i>

23
00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.284
To help people.

24
00:01:17.318 --> 00:01:19.424
I can't share any details.

25
00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:20.942
but we might be looking
into Vella.

26
00:01:20.977 --> 00:01:23.117
Great. So. either
I'm accused of being a traitor

27
00:01:23.152 --> 00:01:25.326
or I become one
to avoid being accused?

28
00:01:25.361 --> 00:01:27.259
We really can't be sure about

29
00:01:27.294 --> 00:01:28.812
the loyalty
of some of these people.

30
00:01:28.847 --> 00:01:30.167
They could banjax
the whole thing.

31
00:01:32.575 --> 00:01:34.784
I sent a photo to the Handler.

32
00:01:34.818 --> 00:01:36.855
He confirms it's the CHIS.

33
00:01:36.889 --> 00:01:39.168
You're not suggesting
Davidson was involved?

34
00:01:39.202 --> 00:01:41.342
You have no idea
what she's capable of.

35
00:01:43.793 --> 00:01:45.277
It's over.

36
00:01:45.312 --> 00:01:46.703
How come
I've never met your family?

37
00:01:46.727 --> 00:01:48.315
I don't have one.

38
00:01:50.731 --> 00:01:52.526
I've released him
without charge.

39
00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:54.562
No way am I going after
someone like Terry Boyle

40
00:01:54.597 --> 00:01:56.737
because he's the easy way out.

41
00:01:56.771 --> 00:01:58.946
Boss. is everything okay?

42
00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:00.982
- I should. er...
- Yeah.

43
00:02:16.757 --> 00:02:18.793
Sir.

44
00:02:18.828 --> 00:02:20.174
Skipper...

45
00:02:21.865 --> 00:02:23.212
Good Morning.

46
00:02:26.215 --> 00:02:28.562
Thank you as you were.
As you were.

47
00:02:28.596 --> 00:02:32.290
I have authorised
an official AC-12 inquiry

48
00:02:32.324 --> 00:02:33.739
into Operation Lighthouse.

49
00:02:33.774 --> 00:02:35.845
Gail Vella's murder

50
00:02:35.879 --> 00:02:38.848
is this force's highest
profile investigation.

51
00:02:38.882 --> 00:02:40.608
It will be our job to detect

52
00:02:40.643 --> 00:02:42.921
whether police misconduct
and/or corruption

53
00:02:42.955 --> 00:02:46.373
has contributed to this murder
remaining unsolved.

54
00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:49.583
- DS Arnott.
- Sir.

55
00:02:50.929 --> 00:02:52.793
SIO on Lighthouse

56
00:02:52.827 --> 00:02:55.554
is Detective Chief Inspector
Joanne Davidson.

57
00:02:55.589 --> 00:02:57.349
No MIT officers are aware

58
00:02:57.384 --> 00:02:59.558
AC-12 is scrutinising
Lighthouse.

59
00:02:59.593 --> 00:03:01.560
All information
we've harvested so far

60
00:03:01.595 --> 00:03:02.813
has been acquired from a source

61
00:03:02.837 --> 00:03:04.977
on The Hill known as Officer J.

62
00:03:11.363 --> 00:03:13.020
...to our inquiry.

63
00:03:13.054 --> 00:03:16.541
- The CHIS's name
was Alastair Oldroyd. - 22.

64
00:03:16.575 --> 00:03:19.751
Oldroyd was in a pub
on the night of October 26th

65
00:03:19.785 --> 00:03:21.787
when the person
calling himself Ross Turner

66
00:03:21.822 --> 00:03:24.411
gave Oldroyd homophobic abuse.

67
00:03:24.445 --> 00:03:26.240
Turner intimidated Oldroyd

68
00:03:26.275 --> 00:03:28.000
by allegedly boasting
of involvement

69
00:03:28.035 --> 00:03:29.726
in Gail Vella's murder.

70
00:03:42.705 --> 00:03:44.061
Sorry. sir.

71
00:03:44.085 --> 00:03:45.742
- have you got a sec?
- Come in.

72
00:03:45.777 --> 00:03:48.469
You don't need me to tell you
we need a witness

73
00:03:48.504 --> 00:03:50.368
to this meeting
between Oldroyd and Turner

74
00:03:50.402 --> 00:03:53.025
to identify whether
it was Boyle or Banks.

75
00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:56.097
Unfortunately. the CHIS lied
about the name of the pub.

76
00:03:56.132 --> 00:03:57.661
Handler believes
he was protecting friends

77
00:03:57.685 --> 00:03:59.584
who trade drugs there.
We're checking out

78
00:03:59.618 --> 00:04:01.424
establishments in the vicinity
of Beechwood House

79
00:04:01.448 --> 00:04:04.589
for CCTV plus Local Authority
cameras in the area

80
00:04:04.623 --> 00:04:06.349
just in the hope
of identifying Oldroyd.

81
00:04:06.384 --> 00:04:08.662
Banks or Boyle
on the night of the 26th.

82
00:04:08.696 --> 00:04:11.423
- Cheers. Chris. crack on.
- Boss.

83
00:04:11.458 --> 00:04:13.356
- Thanks.
- Ma'am.

84
00:04:14.909 --> 00:04:16.394
Boss. obviously
we've got to consider

85
00:04:16.428 --> 00:04:18.327
whether Oldroyd's death
was suicide or murder...

86
00:04:18.361 --> 00:04:19.983
Hence. we're investigating it.

87
00:04:20.018 --> 00:04:22.365
Yeah. I'm not saying anything
you don't know already. boss.

88
00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.367
but if it was murder
then it raises the question

89
00:04:24.402 --> 00:04:26.058
that someone knew Oldroyd
had info

90
00:04:26.093 --> 00:04:28.475
on Gail Vella's death.

91
00:04:28.509 --> 00:04:29.993
I know.

92
00:04:30.028 --> 00:04:31.616
Hate to say it. Kate.

93
00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:33.583
but one thing I've learned
over the years.

94
00:04:33.618 --> 00:04:35.758
the fewer coppers
in the loop. the better.

95
00:05:01.818 --> 00:05:03.475
What's going on
with Farida Jatri?

96
00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:05.374
I was about to ask the same.
sir.

97
00:05:05.408 --> 00:05:07.445
She's just handed
in a transfer request.

98
00:05:07.479 --> 00:05:09.412
"Personal reasons."

99
00:05:09.447 --> 00:05:11.483
She's an experienced PS.

100
00:05:11.518 --> 00:05:13.313
We're at a crucial phase
of Vella.

101
00:05:16.488 --> 00:05:17.800
In confidence. sir.

102
00:05:17.834 --> 00:05:20.423
I've noticed some issues
with PS Jatri.

103
00:05:20.458 --> 00:05:22.667
What kind of issues?

104
00:05:22.701 --> 00:05:24.876
I don't want to say anything

105
00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.533
that might come back
to haunt us.

106
00:05:26.567 --> 00:05:28.569
Last thing you need's
a tribunal.

107
00:05:28.604 --> 00:05:30.606
What?

108
00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.815
I'll draft a glowing reference

109
00:05:32.849 --> 00:05:34.989
and she'll be
some other station's problem.

110
00:05:36.991 --> 00:05:38.441
You're a lifesaver.

111
00:05:39.718 --> 00:05:40.926
Yeah.

112
00:05:51.005 --> 00:05:52.490
- Sir.
- What have you got?

113
00:05:52.524 --> 00:05:53.812
Sir. the team have managed
to pull

114
00:05:53.836 --> 00:05:55.803
some Gail Vella reports
from our archive.

115
00:05:55.838 --> 00:05:58.599
Obviously they all relate
to cases involving AC-12.

116
00:06:00.463 --> 00:06:02.810
<i>- Chief Inspector...
- Chief Inspector Osbourne!</i>

117
00:06:04.571 --> 00:06:05.813
<i>I take pride</i>

118
00:06:05.848 --> 00:06:07.066
<i>in the courage
and professionalism</i>

119
00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.058
<i>of my counterterrorism officers.</i>

120
00:06:09.092 --> 00:06:11.888
<i>To say any more risks
prejudicing the inquest.</i>

121
00:06:11.923 --> 00:06:13.096
<i>Thank you.</i>

122
00:06:15.098 --> 00:06:16.859
<i>Official police statements
record</i>

123
00:06:16.893 --> 00:06:19.793
<i>Counter Terrorism Officers
shouted "Armed Police"</i>

124
00:06:19.827 --> 00:06:22.416
<i>and ordered Mr Ali to surrender.</i>

125
00:06:22.451 --> 00:06:25.246
<i>Mr Ali's widow Aaliyah
insists there was no warning.</i>

126
00:06:25.281 --> 00:06:27.525
<i>no chance to surrender.
before her husband</i>

127
00:06:27.559 --> 00:06:29.596
<i>was gunned down
by a hail of bullets.</i>

128
00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:31.839
They lied through their teeth.

129
00:06:31.874 --> 00:06:34.428
every single one of them.
except you. Steve.

130
00:06:34.463 --> 00:06:35.843
I mean. talk about an outrage.

131
00:06:35.878 --> 00:06:37.604
the commanding officer.
made Chief.

132
00:06:37.638 --> 00:06:39.571
If that had happened
on my patch...

133
00:06:39.606 --> 00:06:41.677
Jesus.

134
00:06:41.711 --> 00:06:42.988
Next one. Chloe.

135
00:06:54.655 --> 00:06:57.037
<i>A jury found Retired
Chief Superintendent</i>

136
00:06:57.071 --> 00:07:00.558
<i>Patrick Fairbank
guilty of all charges.</i>

137
00:07:00.592 --> 00:07:01.835
<i>What that jury didn't hear</i>

138
00:07:01.869 --> 00:07:04.009
<i>and only now
am I allowed to report</i>

139
00:07:04.044 --> 00:07:05.839
<i>are allegations Patrick Fairbank</i>

140
00:07:05.873 --> 00:07:07.875
<i>suppressed police investigations</i>

141
00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:09.670
<i>into child sexual exploitation</i>

142
00:07:09.705 --> 00:07:11.707
<i>that transcended
local political figures</i>

143
00:07:11.741 --> 00:07:13.812
<i>such as Councillor Dale Roach.</i>

144
00:07:13.847 --> 00:07:15.883
<i>It's now a matter
of public record</i>

145
00:07:15.918 --> 00:07:18.058
<i>that Jimmy Savile
cultivated relationships</i>

146
00:07:18.092 --> 00:07:20.025
<i>with senior police officers.</i>

147
00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:21.855
<i>Savile exploited
those relationships</i>

148
00:07:21.889 --> 00:07:23.512
<i>to intimidate anyone</i>

149
00:07:23.546 --> 00:07:26.100
<i>attempting to investigate
his offending.</i>

150
00:07:26.135 --> 00:07:28.068
<i>We now realise
what Savile was getting</i>

151
00:07:28.102 --> 00:07:31.036
<i>out of those relationships
with senior police officers.</i>

152
00:07:31.071 --> 00:07:34.281
<i>What remains unknown.
and uninvestigated.</i>

153
00:07:34.315 --> 00:07:35.834
<i>is what those officers
were getting</i>

154
00:07:35.869 --> 00:07:38.043
<i>out of their relationship
with Savile.</i>

155
00:07:38.078 --> 00:07:39.769
<i>Gail Vella reporting</i>

156
00:07:39.804 --> 00:07:41.737
<i>from Queen Elizabeth Law Courts.</i>

157
00:07:41.771 --> 00:07:43.128
Sir. Gail Vella drew attention

158
00:07:43.152 --> 00:07:44.878
to alleged links
between organised crime.

159
00:07:44.912 --> 00:07:46.949
politicians and senior police officers

160
00:07:46.983 --> 00:07:49.745
and these are just the reports
we found in our own archive.

161
00:07:51.988 --> 00:07:54.508
Wee girl killed in cold blood.

162
00:07:55.992 --> 00:07:57.891
Or a killer. free as a bird.

163
00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.620
- Thank you. Chloe.
- Sir.

164
00:08:06.278 --> 00:08:08.211
- Cheers. Chloe.
- Sarge.

165
00:08:12.906 --> 00:08:14.632
Gaffer. it can't be
a coincidence

166
00:08:14.666 --> 00:08:15.850
Carl Banks
was a violent offender

167
00:08:15.874 --> 00:08:17.186
involved with organised crime.

168
00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:19.050
Yeah. but if your man
pulled the trigger.

169
00:08:19.084 --> 00:08:21.086
that means he's a gun for hire.

170
00:08:21.121 --> 00:08:22.709
That order came from higher up.

171
00:08:22.743 --> 00:08:25.056
But the question still remains

172
00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:27.299
what is the motive
for Gail Vella's murder?

173
00:08:27.334 --> 00:08:28.967
All right. she's
a controversial journalist.

174
00:08:28.991 --> 00:08:31.269
I'll give you that.
but there's no evidence

175
00:08:31.303 --> 00:08:32.684
to suggest
that she dug up anything

176
00:08:32.719 --> 00:08:34.065
that wasn't there before.

177
00:08:34.099 --> 00:08:37.240
Maybe she was working
on something that would...

178
00:08:43.074 --> 00:08:45.525
Superintendent Hastings.

179
00:08:50.184 --> 00:08:51.531
Thanks Steve. Thanks.

180
00:08:53.118 --> 00:08:54.568
Sir.

181
00:08:54.603 --> 00:08:56.363
Yes. I'll be right down.

182
00:09:11.861 --> 00:09:13.218
Steph. what are you doing here?

183
00:09:13.242 --> 00:09:14.840
You promised
you'd call me back. It's HMRC.

184
00:09:14.864 --> 00:09:16.255
Not here. not here.

185
00:09:16.279 --> 00:09:17.902
let's go somewhere private.

186
00:09:53.765 --> 00:09:55.042
- Tea. coffee?
- We're fine.

187
00:09:55.077 --> 00:09:57.044
- Thanks though.
- Cool.

188
00:09:57.079 --> 00:10:00.392
- So. have a seat.
- Yes.

189
00:10:00.427 --> 00:10:02.153
How can I help you?

190
00:10:02.187 --> 00:10:05.052
We'd like to ask you some
questions about Gail Vella.

191
00:10:05.087 --> 00:10:06.271
You were working
with her closely

192
00:10:06.295 --> 00:10:07.779
at the time of her death?

193
00:10:07.814 --> 00:10:09.816
Detectives interviewed me
a few days after.

194
00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:13.336
Our department is conducting
further inquiries.

195
00:10:13.371 --> 00:10:16.477
Yeah. I was her producer
for a couple of years.

196
00:10:16.512 --> 00:10:18.376
One line of inquiry
is she fell victim

197
00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:19.895
to an obsessed fan.

198
00:10:19.929 --> 00:10:21.103
Do you recall any individuals

199
00:10:21.137 --> 00:10:22.898
that gave Gail
cause for concern?

200
00:10:22.932 --> 00:10:24.831
Female journalists
get the worst of it.

201
00:10:24.865 --> 00:10:27.143
From accusations of bias
to threats of sexual violence.

202
00:10:27.178 --> 00:10:28.362
Everything was reported
at the time

203
00:10:28.386 --> 00:10:30.146
to our security
or to the police.

204
00:10:30.181 --> 00:10:31.676
You say Ms Vella
received threats

205
00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.322
as a result of her reporting.

206
00:10:33.356 --> 00:10:35.635
Were there any particularly
controversial reports?

207
00:10:38.016 --> 00:10:39.224
Maybe I should show you.

208
00:10:40.881 --> 00:10:42.400
<i>The Deputy Chief Constable and I</i>

209
00:10:42.434 --> 00:10:44.402
<i>are pleased to report
that Operation Pear Tree</i>

210
00:10:44.436 --> 00:10:46.853
<i>has completed
a thorough investigation</i>

211
00:10:46.887 --> 00:10:48.889
<i>into institutionalised
complicity</i>

212
00:10:48.924 --> 00:10:51.271
<i>between organised criminals
and corrupt police officers.</i>

213
00:10:51.305 --> 00:10:54.723
<i>It's robust findings
couldn't be clearer.</i>

214
00:10:54.757 --> 00:10:57.001
<i>There is no institutionalised
corruption</i>

215
00:10:57.035 --> 00:10:58.519
<i>in this police force.</i>

216
00:11:00.211 --> 00:11:02.903
<i>Operation Pear Tree.
the inquiry described as</i>

217
00:11:02.938 --> 00:11:04.905
<i>"the most thorough"
ever undertaken</i>

218
00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:07.977
<i>into police corruption.
is now officially closed.</i>

219
00:11:08.012 --> 00:11:10.221
<i>Some will wonder why this news</i>

220
00:11:10.255 --> 00:11:12.982
<i>is being announced
over a holiday weekend.</i>

221
00:11:13.017 --> 00:11:14.466
<i>Cynics might conclude the Police</i>

222
00:11:14.501 --> 00:11:17.055
<i>and Crime Commissioner
would prefer his statement</i>

223
00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:19.437
<i>isn't examined too closely.</i>

224
00:11:19.471 --> 00:11:21.266
<i>Perhaps Mr Sindwhani has learned</i>

225
00:11:21.301 --> 00:11:24.062
<i>the secret to high office
appears no longer to reside</i>

226
00:11:24.097 --> 00:11:25.512
<i>in revealing the deepest truths.</i>

227
00:11:25.546 --> 00:11:28.342
<i>but in telling
the most attractive lies.</i>

228
00:11:28.377 --> 00:11:30.137
<i>Gail Vella reporting...</i>

229
00:11:30.172 --> 00:11:32.184
I had to cut that
from the broadcast version.

230
00:11:32.208 --> 00:11:34.107
This unbroadcast material.

231
00:11:34.141 --> 00:11:35.461
it would never
have been released?

232
00:11:35.487 --> 00:11:37.248
Not in this form. no.

233
00:11:37.282 --> 00:11:39.457
She'd seen the success
of a podcast

234
00:11:39.491 --> 00:11:41.770
about police corruption
surrounding the murder

235
00:11:41.804 --> 00:11:43.737
of a private detective.
Daniel Morgan.

236
00:11:43.772 --> 00:11:45.197
The material Gail
couldn't get on air.

237
00:11:45.221 --> 00:11:47.465
she was funnelling into
a podcast serial of her own.

238
00:11:47.499 --> 00:11:49.812
Where can we access
this podcast?

239
00:11:49.847 --> 00:11:52.056
It never got that far. Gail
must not have finished it.

240
00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:54.034
Do you know anything about
the content of this podcast?

241
00:11:54.058 --> 00:11:55.335
I know she was pursuing

242
00:11:55.369 --> 00:11:57.337
several senior police officers
for interviews.

243
00:11:57.371 --> 00:11:59.166
She was digging
much more deeply into why

244
00:11:59.201 --> 00:12:00.799
there'd been suppression
of police inquiries

245
00:12:00.823 --> 00:12:03.101
into the likes
of Councillor Dale Roach.

246
00:12:03.136 --> 00:12:04.516
She keep notes or recordings?

247
00:12:04.551 --> 00:12:07.002
Yes. What journalist wouldn't?

248
00:12:07.036 --> 00:12:08.220
That's why I suggested
Gail's killer

249
00:12:08.244 --> 00:12:10.419
must have stolen them.

250
00:12:10.453 --> 00:12:12.283
Sorry? You disclosed this

251
00:12:12.317 --> 00:12:13.767
to the original
murder detectives?

252
00:12:13.802 --> 00:12:15.148
And they said
there was no grounds

253
00:12:15.182 --> 00:12:16.770
to suspect a burglary.

254
00:12:20.084 --> 00:12:21.544
This is the first
we've heard of burglary

255
00:12:21.568 --> 00:12:23.028
being a factor
in Gail Vella's murder.

256
00:12:23.052 --> 00:12:24.478
Nor was there evidence
of a disturbance

257
00:12:24.502 --> 00:12:25.952
inside of the property.

258
00:12:25.986 --> 00:12:27.816
If the killer stole something.
he knew exactly

259
00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:29.207
what he was looking for
and where to find it.

260
00:12:29.231 --> 00:12:30.991
I'm assuming the original
investigation

261
00:12:31.026 --> 00:12:33.373
seized all of Gail Vella's
electronic devices.

262
00:12:33.407 --> 00:12:34.557
Yes. sir.
They were after messages

263
00:12:34.581 --> 00:12:36.203
or threats from an obsessed fan.

264
00:12:36.238 --> 00:12:37.940
Yes. but they weren't looking
at her journalism.

265
00:12:37.964 --> 00:12:40.035
If your theory is right. Steve.

266
00:12:40.069 --> 00:12:41.633
these files could point
the finger at someone

267
00:12:41.657 --> 00:12:44.315
who may have had a motive
to order her murder.

268
00:12:44.349 --> 00:12:46.904
I think those devices
need to be re-analysed.

269
00:12:46.938 --> 00:12:48.122
We'll have to find
a way to do that

270
00:12:48.146 --> 00:12:50.183
without alerting Davidson.

271
00:12:50.217 --> 00:12:51.391
Right.

272
00:12:51.425 --> 00:12:52.772
Thank you. Chloe.

273
00:12:54.532 --> 00:12:55.878
Sir.

274
00:13:04.128 --> 00:13:05.957
You're worried about
what might happen to Kate

275
00:13:05.992 --> 00:13:08.201
when Davidson finds out
we're investigating her?

276
00:13:08.235 --> 00:13:10.030
- Yes. sir.
- I get it. son. I really do.

277
00:13:10.065 --> 00:13:12.377
I get it. But...

278
00:13:12.412 --> 00:13:14.069
Kate has made her bed.

279
00:13:14.103 --> 00:13:15.553
Now she's got to lie in it.

280
00:13:15.587 --> 00:13:17.279
And we've a job to do.

281
00:13:18.901 --> 00:13:20.178
Sir.

282
00:13:20.213 --> 00:13:21.559
Wait. Steve.

283
00:13:26.288 --> 00:13:28.635
I've been giving the situation
some thought.

284
00:13:30.016 --> 00:13:31.949
And loyalty works both ways.

285
00:13:31.983 --> 00:13:34.675
I'm gonna have to confirm it
with HR

286
00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:37.368
but ahead of the formal
promotion process.

287
00:13:37.402 --> 00:13:39.473
I am making you a Temp DI.

288
00:13:41.717 --> 00:13:44.996
Congratulations. son.
you've earned it.

289
00:13:45.031 --> 00:13:47.205
Thank you. sir.

290
00:14:28.281 --> 00:14:31.629
All right.

291
00:14:32.768 --> 00:14:34.080
Just like old times.

292
00:14:34.114 --> 00:14:35.460
Yeah.

293
00:14:36.668 --> 00:14:38.567
We're moving forward with Vella.

294
00:14:38.601 --> 00:14:40.396
Moving forward how?

295
00:14:40.431 --> 00:14:42.122
At some point we're gonna hit
the Hill.

296
00:14:42.157 --> 00:14:44.193
Shit. for Christ sake. Steve.

297
00:14:44.228 --> 00:14:46.057
This is why I got you here.

298
00:14:46.092 --> 00:14:48.001
I can't leave a digital trail.
But I wanted you to know.

299
00:14:48.025 --> 00:14:49.543
Why are you involving me?

300
00:14:49.578 --> 00:14:53.202
We've got some leads.
but look. Kate.

301
00:14:53.237 --> 00:14:55.411
if you can feed me
the inside track on Davidson.

302
00:14:55.446 --> 00:14:57.010
maybe we won't need
to show our hand just yet...

303
00:14:57.034 --> 00:14:58.656
Christ sake. Steve.
she's me gaffer.

304
00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:01.210
- you want me to rat on her?
- You're no rat if she's bent.

305
00:15:01.245 --> 00:15:03.247
- What am I then?
- An honest copper.

306
00:15:03.281 --> 00:15:05.214
Oh yeah. I'm sure
everyone'll see it like that.

307
00:15:05.249 --> 00:15:07.734
Look. Kate.
it goes beyond Davidson.

308
00:15:07.768 --> 00:15:09.574
If organised crime ordered
the murder of Gail Vella.

309
00:15:09.598 --> 00:15:11.980
they're protecting Carl Banks
and framing Terry Boyle.

310
00:15:12.014 --> 00:15:14.499
Yeah. we get it.
We're working on it.

311
00:15:14.534 --> 00:15:16.329
Look. I just need to know when.

312
00:15:16.363 --> 00:15:17.651
When is it going
to come out that AC-12

313
00:15:17.675 --> 00:15:19.642
are investigating Davidson?

314
00:15:19.677 --> 00:15:22.024
I've already said too much.

315
00:15:22.059 --> 00:15:23.405
Yeah. likewise.

316
00:15:26.787 --> 00:15:28.720
You always chose
a right shithole.

317
00:15:49.845 --> 00:15:51.364
All right. Chris.

318
00:15:51.398 --> 00:15:52.789
Pathologist's
in there now. boss.

319
00:15:52.813 --> 00:15:54.436
Knife wound to the throat.

320
00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.541
Looks like the body's
been here for a few days.

321
00:15:56.576 --> 00:15:58.095
Witnesses?

322
00:15:58.129 --> 00:15:59.382
This is a long derelict site

323
00:15:59.406 --> 00:16:01.719
with no security presence
and no CCTV.

324
00:16:01.753 --> 00:16:04.584
Highly unlikely we'll harvest
any surveillance images.

325
00:16:04.618 --> 00:16:06.724
Any ID yet?

326
00:16:06.758 --> 00:16:09.623
Matches the appearance
of Carl Banks.

327
00:16:15.077 --> 00:16:16.251
Shit.

328
00:16:16.285 --> 00:16:18.011
Good news. ma'am.

329
00:16:18.046 --> 00:16:19.326
The search team's found a knife.

330
00:16:21.635 --> 00:16:23.603
No apparent blood
deposits on the ground.

331
00:16:23.637 --> 00:16:25.156
The Best test for them anyway.

332
00:16:25.191 --> 00:16:26.375
The killer didn't put
much effort

333
00:16:26.399 --> 00:16:28.021
into evidence disposal.

334
00:16:30.817 --> 00:16:33.199
DI Fleming.
Farida's replacement.

335
00:16:33.233 --> 00:16:35.856
- PC Ryan...
- Pilkington. ma'am.

336
00:16:35.891 --> 00:16:37.548
Pleased to meet you. ma'am.

337
00:16:37.582 --> 00:16:40.206
Don't knock it. Kate.
We're overdue a lucky break.

338
00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:41.759
- Thanks. Ryan.
- Ma'am.

339
00:16:51.389 --> 00:16:52.873
Fingerprints were only
a 90% match

340
00:16:52.908 --> 00:16:55.359
due to early decomposition
but DNA's confirmed

341
00:16:55.393 --> 00:16:56.681
the body is definitely
Carl Banks.

342
00:16:56.705 --> 00:16:58.638
Sorry. ma'am.

343
00:16:58.672 --> 00:17:00.098
you asked to receive
the forensic report

344
00:17:00.122 --> 00:17:02.090
- as soon as it was in.
- Thanks. Ryan.

345
00:17:02.124 --> 00:17:04.299
You couldn't do us a cuppa.
could you? I'm gasping.

346
00:17:04.333 --> 00:17:05.610
Yeah. No problem at all. ma'am.

347
00:17:05.645 --> 00:17:07.750
- DI Fleming. DS Lomax?
- I'm fine. ta.

348
00:17:07.785 --> 00:17:10.512
Me too but this has been
bugging me.

349
00:17:10.546 --> 00:17:12.445
have we worked together before?

350
00:17:12.479 --> 00:17:15.310
Did you come and give a talk
at Training College. ma'am?

351
00:17:15.344 --> 00:17:17.312
No.

352
00:17:17.346 --> 00:17:19.417
- Thanks. Ryan.
- Ma'am.

353
00:17:21.454 --> 00:17:23.145
Christ sake.

354
00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:24.767
Boss?

355
00:17:24.802 --> 00:17:27.391
Fingerprints on the knife
found close to Carl Banks's

356
00:17:27.425 --> 00:17:30.877
body match Alastair Oldroyd.
The CHIS.

357
00:17:30.911 --> 00:17:32.637
The pathologist confirmed
Banks died

358
00:17:32.672 --> 00:17:34.432
a couple of days earlier.
The timeline works

359
00:17:34.467 --> 00:17:35.651
for Oldroyd
to have killed Banks.

360
00:17:35.675 --> 00:17:37.159
Yeah.

361
00:17:37.194 --> 00:17:38.919
Sarge.

362
00:17:38.954 --> 00:17:40.473
Err. I mean Sir.

363
00:17:47.445 --> 00:17:51.242
- Shit. Sir.
- What have you got?

364
00:17:51.277 --> 00:17:52.864
Sir. it's just come up
on the Box.

365
00:17:52.899 --> 00:17:55.108
Carl Banks has been found dead.

366
00:17:55.143 --> 00:17:56.661
No more beating about the bush.

367
00:17:56.696 --> 00:17:59.526
- We raid Operation Lighthouse.
- Sir.

368
00:17:59.561 --> 00:18:01.804
I'll put together a team
and transport.

369
00:18:10.606 --> 00:18:12.298
AC-12. DI Arnott.

370
00:18:12.332 --> 00:18:14.334
It's your lawful duty
to comply with my officers.

371
00:18:14.369 --> 00:18:15.577
Sir.

372
00:18:44.261 --> 00:18:45.848
DI Arnott. AC-12.

373
00:18:45.883 --> 00:18:47.954
We have the lawful
authority to investigate

374
00:18:47.988 --> 00:18:49.473
Operation Lighthouse.

375
00:18:49.507 --> 00:18:51.475
All officers go to your desks.

376
00:18:51.509 --> 00:18:53.925
You'll each be questioned
by an AC-12 case worker.

377
00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:56.273
You'll each be obliged
to surrender all materials

378
00:18:56.307 --> 00:18:57.791
relating to Operation Lighthouse

379
00:18:57.826 --> 00:18:59.517
to said case workers.

380
00:18:59.552 --> 00:19:01.795
Failure to comply will be
a breach of your Duties

381
00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:04.557
and Responsibilities under
Police Conduct Regulations

382
00:19:04.591 --> 00:19:06.352
and may lead
to a misconduct charge

383
00:19:06.386 --> 00:19:08.837
- under said regulations.
- Nobody move.

384
00:19:08.871 --> 00:19:10.425
What the hell's all this about?

385
00:19:10.459 --> 00:19:12.299
- On whose authority?
- We have a signed authority

386
00:19:12.323 --> 00:19:13.887
from Deputy Chief
Constable Wise to seize

387
00:19:13.911 --> 00:19:17.432
all MIT files relating
to the murder of Gail Vella.

388
00:19:17.466 --> 00:19:18.950
Let me see that.

389
00:19:18.985 --> 00:19:20.745
Sir. as you know.
willful obstruction

390
00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:22.782
of my officers executing
their lawful duty

391
00:19:22.816 --> 00:19:25.474
- is a criminal offence.
- DCI Davidson.

392
00:19:25.509 --> 00:19:29.237
I notified the DCC
of my concerns regarding

393
00:19:29.271 --> 00:19:31.584
leaking of confidential
police information

394
00:19:31.618 --> 00:19:34.207
such as the operation
to arrest Ross Turner

395
00:19:34.242 --> 00:19:35.484
and the identity of the CHIS

396
00:19:35.519 --> 00:19:37.521
who gave us Turner's name
and address.

397
00:19:37.555 --> 00:19:40.317
The DCC agreed to a moratorium

398
00:19:40.351 --> 00:19:41.594
on further distribution

399
00:19:41.628 --> 00:19:42.974
of Operation Lighthouse files

400
00:19:43.009 --> 00:19:44.631
until said information leakage

401
00:19:44.666 --> 00:19:46.426
has been fully investigated.

402
00:19:46.461 --> 00:19:48.014
We'd be the ones
to investigate it!

403
00:19:48.048 --> 00:19:50.913
Nonetheless you'll see
the DCC's authorised me

404
00:19:50.948 --> 00:19:52.846
to withhold Operation
Lighthouse files.

405
00:19:52.881 --> 00:19:54.779
Why didn't the DCC
inform us about this?

406
00:19:54.814 --> 00:19:57.610
To prevent information
leakage. naturally.

407
00:19:57.644 --> 00:20:00.371
No. he did it
to make mugs of AC-12.

408
00:20:00.406 --> 00:20:02.408
That was just an added bonus.

409
00:20:06.998 --> 00:20:10.036
- Priceless!
- Let's go.

410
00:20:10.070 --> 00:20:11.693
Right. everyone. let's go.

411
00:20:23.463 --> 00:20:25.293
Cheers. Kate. nice one.

412
00:20:38.858 --> 00:20:40.825
How did Davidson know?

413
00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:42.068
Give me a minute.

414
00:20:55.909 --> 00:20:57.083
Steve. I'm sorry.

415
00:20:57.117 --> 00:20:58.740
I trusted you. mate.

416
00:20:58.774 --> 00:21:01.329
Look. I'm damned if I do.
I'm damned if I don't.

417
00:21:01.363 --> 00:21:02.675
What was I supposed to do?

418
00:21:18.725 --> 00:21:21.763
Andrea advised me this is
about Operation Lighthouse.

419
00:21:21.797 --> 00:21:23.558
I need to be in the loop.

420
00:21:23.592 --> 00:21:25.594
Well. I am here because AC-12's

421
00:21:25.629 --> 00:21:29.667
lawful investigation
has been unjustly obstructed.

422
00:21:29.702 --> 00:21:32.360
Operation Lighthouse
has had its setbacks of course

423
00:21:32.394 --> 00:21:35.086
but your involvement
needs to be correctly handled

424
00:21:35.121 --> 00:21:37.399
so the public don't leap
to the wrong conclusion.

425
00:21:37.434 --> 00:21:40.920
I've briefed Andrea
on the required optics.

426
00:21:40.954 --> 00:21:42.611
This isn't an inquiry

427
00:21:42.646 --> 00:21:45.752
into misconduct
slash corruption.

428
00:21:45.787 --> 00:21:49.687
Well. the investigation
usually precedes the findings.

429
00:21:49.722 --> 00:21:51.655
Clearly. we're all frustrated

430
00:21:51.689 --> 00:21:54.865
Gail Vella's murderer hasn't
been brought to justice yet.

431
00:21:54.899 --> 00:21:58.455
so it makes sense to pitch
AC-12's involvement

432
00:21:58.489 --> 00:22:00.491
as a routine performance review.

433
00:22:02.562 --> 00:22:05.841
Officers of your rank
normally appreciate politics

434
00:22:05.876 --> 00:22:07.049
as much as policing.

435
00:22:07.084 --> 00:22:09.569
Yes.

436
00:22:09.604 --> 00:22:12.917
I'm interested in one thing
and one thing only.

437
00:22:12.952 --> 00:22:14.367
And that's bent coppers.

438
00:22:15.748 --> 00:22:17.612
I hope you'll cooperate.
Superintendent.

439
00:22:17.646 --> 00:22:20.511
Now. apologies.
if you'll excuse me.

440
00:22:20.546 --> 00:22:22.168
I'm due to attend
the Crime Executive.

441
00:22:22.202 --> 00:22:23.549
Sir.

442
00:22:26.862 --> 00:22:30.003
Unless there are
any outstanding issues. Ted.

443
00:22:30.038 --> 00:22:32.730
I'm prepared to reissue
the authority for AC-12

444
00:22:32.765 --> 00:22:36.562
to proceed with your review
of Operation Lighthouse.

445
00:22:36.596 --> 00:22:38.426
It appears my team
have been delayed

446
00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:40.531
for nothing better
than a PR briefing.

447
00:22:40.566 --> 00:22:43.396
the result of which
is that MIT officers

448
00:22:43.431 --> 00:22:45.467
are now aware of our inquiry

449
00:22:45.502 --> 00:22:48.574
and may be concealing evidence
as we speak!

450
00:22:48.608 --> 00:22:50.714
No one's concealing evidence.
Ted.

451
00:22:50.748 --> 00:22:52.036
They're working their
bollocks off

452
00:22:52.060 --> 00:22:53.682
trying to find
Gail Vella's killer.

453
00:22:53.717 --> 00:22:55.753
Ma'am.

454
00:23:03.174 --> 00:23:04.900
How'd it go. sir?

455
00:23:04.935 --> 00:23:06.971
Well. We're back in business.

456
00:23:07.006 --> 00:23:08.559
Thank you. sir.

457
00:23:08.594 --> 00:23:10.906
So. you make the mess

458
00:23:10.941 --> 00:23:13.219
and I tidy it up.
is that how this goes?

459
00:23:14.807 --> 00:23:15.980
Well. you're not denying it

460
00:23:16.015 --> 00:23:17.233
so it must have been Officer J.

461
00:23:17.257 --> 00:23:19.881
Or DI Kate Fleming
who blew the gaff.

462
00:23:19.915 --> 00:23:21.641
I reckon you'd only trust Kate

463
00:23:21.676 --> 00:23:24.126
with that kind of information.
yeah?

464
00:23:24.161 --> 00:23:26.508
Well. she's cooked
her goose now.

465
00:23:26.543 --> 00:23:28.476
God help her if she thinks
she's gonna get

466
00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:30.063
some kind of special treatment
from me.

467
00:23:30.098 --> 00:23:31.593
because she's got
another thing coming.

468
00:23:31.617 --> 00:23:33.826
As for DCI Davidson.
she must have had

469
00:23:33.860 --> 00:23:36.725
great fun pulling this stroke.

470
00:23:36.760 --> 00:23:38.841
But she will be laughing
on the other side of her face

471
00:23:38.865 --> 00:23:40.557
when I'm finished with her.

472
00:23:40.591 --> 00:23:43.111
Serve her with a Reg 15.

473
00:23:43.145 --> 00:23:44.975
- Sir.
- Carry on.

474
00:24:26.810 --> 00:24:28.570
DC Bishop. AC-12.

475
00:24:28.605 --> 00:24:30.099
I'm sure you can all guess
what this is about.

476
00:24:30.123 --> 00:24:31.815
I need access to your computer.

477
00:24:31.849 --> 00:24:33.713
Could you stand up. please.

478
00:24:35.197 --> 00:24:37.061
Show me your files. please.

479
00:24:40.720 --> 00:24:42.135
Can I have your passwords.
please.

480
00:24:42.170 --> 00:24:43.792
I need your login details.

481
00:24:48.107 --> 00:24:50.143
What is this document here?

482
00:24:50.178 --> 00:24:51.524
Here you go. sir.

483
00:24:55.977 --> 00:24:59.049
Ma'am. please find enclosed
a Regulation 15 notice

484
00:24:59.083 --> 00:25:01.810
requiring you to attend
AC-12 for a formal interview

485
00:25:01.845 --> 00:25:03.329
within the next 10 working days.

486
00:25:05.296 --> 00:25:06.815
A copy of this letter
has been sent

487
00:25:06.850 --> 00:25:09.059
to your Police Federation
Representative.

488
00:25:54.449 --> 00:25:57.590
- Steve?
- I was up on a case.

489
00:25:57.625 --> 00:25:59.419
I'm sorry. Steph.
I should've called.

490
00:25:59.454 --> 00:26:01.767
No. no. it's fine. come in.

491
00:26:07.393 --> 00:26:09.360
- Tea. isn't it?
- Yeah. Ta.

492
00:26:12.778 --> 00:26:14.124
How are the girls?

493
00:26:14.158 --> 00:26:17.610
Gemma still doesn't get it.
not really.

494
00:26:17.645 --> 00:26:19.105
I'm dreading her
not remembering her daddy.

495
00:26:19.129 --> 00:26:20.820
These'll help.

496
00:26:20.855 --> 00:26:22.166
John won't be forgotten.

497
00:26:23.789 --> 00:26:26.239
Thanks for all you did
at the time.

498
00:26:26.274 --> 00:26:27.689
You didn't have to.

499
00:26:29.449 --> 00:26:32.142
I'd like to think he'd
have done the same for me.

500
00:26:32.176 --> 00:26:34.938
He died in the line of duty.

501
00:26:34.972 --> 00:26:37.699
Shame the big bosses
never saw it that way.

502
00:26:39.252 --> 00:26:41.116
Sorry. I ought to know.
milk and sugar?

503
00:26:41.151 --> 00:26:42.946
Just milk. please.

504
00:26:52.093 --> 00:26:53.957
It's good you were able
to keep the house.

505
00:26:53.991 --> 00:26:55.648
I know you were worried.

506
00:26:55.683 --> 00:26:57.685
Tearing me hair out more like.

507
00:26:57.719 --> 00:27:00.101
Fortunately. there was
John's life insurance.

508
00:27:02.275 --> 00:27:03.622
Nice TV.

509
00:27:04.933 --> 00:27:06.763
Champions' League game's
on later.

510
00:27:06.797 --> 00:27:08.154
Not that you lot've got
an interest.

511
00:27:08.178 --> 00:27:09.973
Next season.

512
00:27:10.007 --> 00:27:12.423
I didn't know you'd bother
with the sports channels.

513
00:27:12.458 --> 00:27:15.495
It all comes in a package.
Cheap as chips.

514
00:27:15.530 --> 00:27:18.429
Sorry. what am I like? Sit down.

515
00:27:23.089 --> 00:27:25.851
Steve?

516
00:27:27.300 --> 00:27:29.855
It's just a spasm. It'll pass.

517
00:27:29.889 --> 00:27:31.788
You sure?

518
00:27:33.962 --> 00:27:35.353
I've got some painkillers
in the car.

519
00:27:35.377 --> 00:27:37.138
Don't move. I'll get them.

520
00:27:37.172 --> 00:27:38.726
I'll get your car keys.

521
00:27:38.760 --> 00:27:40.037
Inside pocket.

522
00:28:25.255 --> 00:28:28.914
I can't believe the DCC
caved so easily.

523
00:28:28.948 --> 00:28:30.985
Sorry. boss.

524
00:28:32.227 --> 00:28:33.746
Not your fault at all.

525
00:28:33.781 --> 00:28:35.334
Thanks for the heads-up.

526
00:28:35.368 --> 00:28:37.888
I know the kind of cases
that AC-12 are into. boss.

527
00:28:40.373 --> 00:28:42.341
Out of work. forget "Boss".

528
00:28:47.277 --> 00:28:48.485
You all right?

529
00:28:51.522 --> 00:28:55.216
- This Reg 15...
- Yeah.

530
00:28:55.250 --> 00:28:57.252
I know how it must feel.

531
00:28:57.287 --> 00:29:00.048
but it's just the way
AC-12 operate.

532
00:29:02.948 --> 00:29:04.190
Truth is.

533
00:29:04.225 --> 00:29:06.606
it's all getting a bit tense.

534
00:29:06.641 --> 00:29:08.608
How's it make me look.
investigating a guy

535
00:29:08.643 --> 00:29:11.370
with learning difficulties...

536
00:29:11.404 --> 00:29:12.820
Straight up. Jo.

537
00:29:12.854 --> 00:29:14.856
do you think
he could have killed Gail?

538
00:29:17.203 --> 00:29:18.998
You've been doing this job
long enough

539
00:29:19.033 --> 00:29:21.932
to realise we can never know
for sure.

540
00:29:21.967 --> 00:29:24.176
We just gather the evidence.

541
00:29:24.210 --> 00:29:25.556
do our best.

542
00:29:26.972 --> 00:29:28.525
And right now.
my best is nowhere near

543
00:29:28.559 --> 00:29:29.906
good enough.

544
00:29:31.631 --> 00:29:33.806
A young woman...

545
00:29:33.841 --> 00:29:35.256
could've been you or me. Kate.

546
00:29:35.290 --> 00:29:37.085
her life cut short.

547
00:29:38.949 --> 00:29:40.640
And whoever did
it's got away with it.

548
00:29:40.675 --> 00:29:42.263
and that's my fault.

549
00:29:44.506 --> 00:29:45.887
Do you fancy another?

550
00:29:45.922 --> 00:29:47.026
Ladies.

551
00:29:48.579 --> 00:29:49.995
Two more. please.

552
00:29:50.029 --> 00:29:51.203
Can we get those?

553
00:29:59.245 --> 00:30:01.834
Have a good night. guys.

554
00:30:01.869 --> 00:30:03.940
- Two more. please.
- Certainly.

555
00:30:07.184 --> 00:30:09.152
I'm sorry. Kate.

556
00:30:09.186 --> 00:30:11.464
my self-pity's
blown your chances.

557
00:30:11.499 --> 00:30:13.432
Na. not really my type.

558
00:30:22.165 --> 00:30:23.511
You sure you're okay to drive?

559
00:30:23.545 --> 00:30:26.410
Yes. Sorry about all that
earlier. I'm fine.

560
00:30:26.445 --> 00:30:28.447
Last thing I meant
was to put you out.

561
00:30:28.481 --> 00:30:30.321
Gerraway. it was nice
to have some grownup company

562
00:30:30.345 --> 00:30:31.415
for a change.

563
00:30:34.522 --> 00:30:36.455
This a long job?

564
00:30:36.489 --> 00:30:38.077
The case you're up here on?

565
00:30:39.492 --> 00:30:40.977
Could be.

566
00:30:41.011 --> 00:30:43.255
If you're passing again.
don't hesitate.

567
00:30:53.265 --> 00:30:54.645
Don't stay out. it's freezing.

568
00:30:54.680 --> 00:30:57.683
I've got to set the sat nav
and everything.

569
00:30:57.717 --> 00:31:00.237
Night. Steve. safe journey.

570
00:31:01.273 --> 00:31:02.377
Night.

571
00:31:12.974 --> 00:31:14.976
Thanks for coming out. Kate.

572
00:31:15.011 --> 00:31:17.082
Sorry to unload my problems.

573
00:31:17.116 --> 00:31:19.532
No worries. glad I could be
a sounding board.

574
00:31:21.362 --> 00:31:23.295
Well. this is me.

575
00:31:24.744 --> 00:31:26.608
It's Mark's turn
to have Josh this weekend.

576
00:31:26.643 --> 00:31:27.989
If you're at a loose end...

577
00:31:29.991 --> 00:31:32.235
I need to check my diary.

578
00:31:32.269 --> 00:31:33.650
Yeah. No pressure.

579
00:31:43.177 --> 00:31:45.558
My diary's empty.

580
00:31:45.593 --> 00:31:48.147
I've just come out
of a long-term relationship.

581
00:31:48.182 --> 00:31:49.562
I. uh...

582
00:31:55.741 --> 00:31:58.226
It would be nice
to see you at the weekend.

583
00:32:23.562 --> 00:32:25.322
Chloe. how's it going?

584
00:32:25.357 --> 00:32:26.575
Davidson gave us
full cooperation.

585
00:32:26.599 --> 00:32:27.738
So we got the lot.

586
00:32:27.773 --> 00:32:29.154
We've recovered
Vella's computers

587
00:32:29.188 --> 00:32:30.579
that were seized
straight after her murder.

588
00:32:30.603 --> 00:32:32.133
I thought you'd want
to prioritise them.

589
00:32:32.157 --> 00:32:33.477
- Great. Hi. Amanda.
- Hi.

590
00:32:33.503 --> 00:32:35.023
The Digital Forensics Team
have triaged

591
00:32:35.056 --> 00:32:37.127
the desk-top computer.
the lap-top computer.

592
00:32:37.162 --> 00:32:38.622
The truth is.
they're remarkably clean.

593
00:32:38.646 --> 00:32:40.027
What do you mean?

594
00:32:40.061 --> 00:32:41.556
All applications
still had store settings.

595
00:32:41.580 --> 00:32:43.202
Hardly any personal files.

596
00:32:43.237 --> 00:32:44.514
Well they were planted.

597
00:32:44.548 --> 00:32:46.043
Her killer replaced
her actual computers

598
00:32:46.067 --> 00:32:47.310
to cover up the burglary.

599
00:32:47.344 --> 00:32:48.804
I'll order
the keyboards to be swabbed

600
00:32:48.828 --> 00:32:50.530
and screens fingerprinted
that way we can see

601
00:32:50.554 --> 00:32:52.073
if Gail ever even touched them.

602
00:32:52.108 --> 00:32:53.499
Good call. So.
you've found nothing at all?

603
00:32:53.523 --> 00:32:54.638
The only item of interest

604
00:32:54.662 --> 00:32:56.043
is a tiny audio file.

605
00:32:56.077 --> 00:32:57.527
It appears
only partially downloaded.

606
00:32:57.561 --> 00:32:59.781
- How would that happen?
- Going with your theory.

607
00:32:59.805 --> 00:33:01.196
it would be
when the murderer installed

608
00:33:01.220 --> 00:33:02.635
the replacement devices.

609
00:33:02.670 --> 00:33:04.475
They would have synced
to her phone momentarily.

610
00:33:04.499 --> 00:33:05.752
started to import the audio file

611
00:33:05.776 --> 00:33:07.330
before the murderer
broke the link.

612
00:33:07.364 --> 00:33:10.229
That would involve him
knowing her passwords.

613
00:33:10.264 --> 00:33:11.679
Sorry.

614
00:33:11.713 --> 00:33:13.681
<i>...Savile lied to cover them up.</i>

615
00:33:13.715 --> 00:33:16.201
<i>Some police officers
not only accepted those lies.</i>

616
00:33:16.235 --> 00:33:17.857
<i>They propagated them.</i>

617
00:33:17.892 --> 00:33:20.239
<i>We're losing our power
to challenge lies.</i>

618
00:33:20.274 --> 00:33:22.345
<i>There's some people
you can't challenge.</i>

619
00:33:25.417 --> 00:33:27.039
<i>Okay. So.</i>

620
00:33:27.074 --> 00:33:29.145
<i>we're losing our power
to challenge lies.</i>

621
00:33:29.179 --> 00:33:31.354
<i>There's some people
you can't challenge.</i>

622
00:33:40.087 --> 00:33:42.192
Sorry. sir.

623
00:33:42.227 --> 00:33:44.470
I didn't think
you'd still be here.

624
00:33:44.505 --> 00:33:46.783
We need to find
the rest of Gail's recordings.

625
00:33:46.817 --> 00:33:48.750
Yeah. Amanda said she's on it.

626
00:33:57.863 --> 00:33:59.451
D'you mind me asking. sir.

627
00:33:59.485 --> 00:34:01.384
but why have these been put up?

628
00:34:02.937 --> 00:34:05.595
The Gaffer's never
going to give it up.

629
00:34:05.629 --> 00:34:07.838
not as long as he still runs
this place.

630
00:34:07.873 --> 00:34:10.738
- And what about you?
- What about me?

631
00:34:10.772 --> 00:34:12.336
Well. do you still believe
there's a fourth man

632
00:34:12.360 --> 00:34:14.466
out there? H?

633
00:34:18.642 --> 00:34:20.265
I've moved on.

634
00:34:47.706 --> 00:34:49.294
That's us now.

635
00:35:08.830 --> 00:35:10.832
Anticorruption Unit 12 interview

636
00:35:10.867 --> 00:35:12.869
of Detective Chief Inspector
Joanne Davidson

637
00:35:12.903 --> 00:35:15.354
in the presence of her Police
Federation Representative

638
00:35:15.389 --> 00:35:18.702
DCI John Rix
by Superintendent Hastings.

639
00:35:18.737 --> 00:35:20.187
Detective Inspector Arnott.

640
00:35:20.221 --> 00:35:23.190
and Detective Constable Bishop.

641
00:35:23.224 --> 00:35:26.365
Ma'am. this interview relates
to Operation Lighthouse.

642
00:35:26.400 --> 00:35:28.333
the inquiry into the murder
of Gail Vella

643
00:35:28.367 --> 00:35:30.818
on September 10th. 2019.

644
00:35:30.852 --> 00:35:32.820
on which you've been
Senior Investigating Officer

645
00:35:32.854 --> 00:35:35.409
since 6th of October
of that same year.

646
00:35:35.443 --> 00:35:37.411
Document 6 in your folders.

647
00:35:37.445 --> 00:35:39.896
Document 6 is a copy
of an incident report

648
00:35:39.930 --> 00:35:42.278
lawfully seized by AC-12
from the offices

649
00:35:42.312 --> 00:35:43.762
of the Murder Investigation Team

650
00:35:43.796 --> 00:35:45.660
located at Hillside Lane
Police Station

651
00:35:45.695 --> 00:35:47.386
on the 4th of November.

652
00:35:47.421 --> 00:35:49.457
Said incident report
describes events

653
00:35:49.492 --> 00:35:51.390
on the morning of 27th October.

654
00:35:51.425 --> 00:35:54.290
specifically the diversion
and delay of an operation

655
00:35:54.324 --> 00:35:56.740
to arrest a suspect
in the murder of Gail Vella

656
00:35:56.775 --> 00:35:58.949
in order to attend
an Armed Robbery taking place

657
00:35:58.984 --> 00:36:01.400
at Hickey's Bookmakers.
Verlaine Road.

658
00:36:01.435 --> 00:36:03.954
On screen. Images 11 to 14.

659
00:36:03.989 --> 00:36:07.682
Images 11 to 14 show
street views of said location.

660
00:36:09.028 --> 00:36:10.858
DCI Davidson.
can you kindly explain

661
00:36:10.892 --> 00:36:12.963
your actions
on the morning of October 27th

662
00:36:12.998 --> 00:36:15.828
in relation
to this Armed Robbery.

663
00:36:17.554 --> 00:36:19.418
En route to arrest the suspect.

664
00:36:19.453 --> 00:36:21.696
I observed a suspicious vehicle.

665
00:36:21.731 --> 00:36:24.665
further inquiries detected
an armed robbery in progress.

666
00:36:24.699 --> 00:36:26.805
I ordered my officers
to intervene.

667
00:36:26.839 --> 00:36:29.221
DCI Davidson's actions
prevented a serious

668
00:36:29.256 --> 00:36:31.706
and immediate threat
to members of the public.

669
00:36:31.741 --> 00:36:33.467
Commendable.

670
00:36:33.501 --> 00:36:34.778
DI Arnott.

671
00:36:34.813 --> 00:36:37.471
Image 14 on screen.

672
00:36:37.505 --> 00:36:39.369
Image 14 shows the line of sight

673
00:36:39.404 --> 00:36:41.060
from the route of the MIT convoy

674
00:36:41.095 --> 00:36:43.373
to the location
of the suspicious vehicle.

675
00:36:43.408 --> 00:36:45.410
Given you were
a front-facing passenger.

676
00:36:45.444 --> 00:36:46.721
it was a narrow line of sight.

677
00:36:46.756 --> 00:36:49.724
And plus. you were going
like the clappers.

678
00:36:49.759 --> 00:36:51.761
Nonetheless.
I did see the vehicle.

679
00:36:51.795 --> 00:36:53.935
and as a result.
numerous members of the public

680
00:36:53.970 --> 00:36:56.731
were saved
from a terrifying ordeal.

681
00:36:56.766 --> 00:36:58.733
Oh.

682
00:36:58.768 --> 00:37:00.873
And what was it about
this vehicle?

683
00:37:00.908 --> 00:37:02.634
- Sir?
- I mean.

684
00:37:02.668 --> 00:37:04.912
it's just an ordinary van
parked in an ordinary street.

685
00:37:04.946 --> 00:37:07.259
Why give it the time of day?

686
00:37:07.294 --> 00:37:09.986
A registration check
proved suspicious.

687
00:37:10.020 --> 00:37:12.057
Yes. but you only found that out

688
00:37:12.091 --> 00:37:14.232
after you stopped
to investigate.

689
00:37:16.406 --> 00:37:18.477
It was an idling MPV
parked adjacent

690
00:37:18.512 --> 00:37:19.858
to a bookmakers.

691
00:37:19.892 --> 00:37:21.860
The driver wasn't reading
a newspaper

692
00:37:21.894 --> 00:37:23.448
or messing about on his phone.

693
00:37:23.482 --> 00:37:25.588
His eyes were fixed
on the bookies.

694
00:37:25.622 --> 00:37:28.832
He was alert
for a quick getaway.

695
00:37:28.867 --> 00:37:32.457
And you deduced all that
in the fraction of a second?

696
00:37:32.491 --> 00:37:34.769
Call it a police officer's
instinct.

697
00:37:34.804 --> 00:37:36.324
Oh. yes. we all get those.

698
00:37:36.357 --> 00:37:38.290
from time-to-time DCI Davidson.

699
00:37:38.325 --> 00:37:40.913
I might be getting one
right now.

700
00:37:40.948 --> 00:37:42.846
DC Bishop.

701
00:37:42.881 --> 00:37:44.641
We've examined MIT records

702
00:37:44.676 --> 00:37:46.574
in relation
to the Armed Robbery.

703
00:37:46.609 --> 00:37:48.921
Document 12 in your folders

704
00:37:48.956 --> 00:37:52.097
and Image 20 on screen.

705
00:37:52.131 --> 00:37:54.755
Image 20 shows the men
arrested in the act

706
00:37:54.789 --> 00:37:57.309
of conducting an Armed Robbery
of Hickey's Bookmakers

707
00:37:57.344 --> 00:37:59.311
on the 27th of October.

708
00:37:59.346 --> 00:38:00.830
None of these men has a history

709
00:38:00.864 --> 00:38:02.556
of serious or violent crime.

710
00:38:02.590 --> 00:38:04.661
The robbery took place
early in the morning

711
00:38:04.696 --> 00:38:06.525
when takings
would be at their lowest.

712
00:38:06.560 --> 00:38:07.709
So. what would you deduce

713
00:38:07.733 --> 00:38:10.564
from these facts. DCI Davidson?

714
00:38:10.598 --> 00:38:13.636
A group of amateur criminals
attempted an armed robbery

715
00:38:13.670 --> 00:38:15.810
in an amateur fashion.

716
00:38:15.845 --> 00:38:17.778
According
to Murder Investigation Team

717
00:38:17.812 --> 00:38:19.952
files lawfully seized
on the 4th of November.

718
00:38:19.987 --> 00:38:21.620
attending the Armed Robbery
on the morning

719
00:38:21.644 --> 00:38:23.473
of the 27th of October
caused a delay

720
00:38:23.508 --> 00:38:25.130
of two hours
and twenty-five minutes

721
00:38:25.164 --> 00:38:27.443
to the operation
planned to arrest a suspect

722
00:38:27.477 --> 00:38:29.721
using the alias Ross Turner
believed to reside

723
00:38:29.755 --> 00:38:32.448
-at Flat 4
-F. Beechwood House.
Moss Heath.

724
00:38:32.482 --> 00:38:35.140
This delay was out
of DCI Davidson's control.

725
00:38:35.174 --> 00:38:36.831
One of the Armed Robbers
was shot dead

726
00:38:36.866 --> 00:38:38.764
by an Authorised
Firearms Officer.

727
00:38:38.799 --> 00:38:40.801
This necessitated
a forensic deployment

728
00:38:40.835 --> 00:38:42.423
and replacement AFOs.

729
00:38:42.458 --> 00:38:43.942
We also understand
that an authority

730
00:38:43.976 --> 00:38:46.945
for Directed Surveillance
applied to Beechwood House.

731
00:38:46.979 --> 00:38:48.440
The required authority
should have been

732
00:38:48.464 --> 00:38:49.982
for Intrusive Surveillance.

733
00:38:50.017 --> 00:38:52.053
As a result.
while the matter was resolved.

734
00:38:52.088 --> 00:38:53.676
surveillance was absent
for a period

735
00:38:53.710 --> 00:38:55.678
of three hours
and thirty-five minutes.

736
00:38:55.712 --> 00:38:57.680
It needed to be resolved.

737
00:38:57.714 --> 00:38:59.958
Any evidence captured
during the wrong authority

738
00:38:59.992 --> 00:39:01.408
would've been inadmissible.

739
00:39:01.442 --> 00:39:03.040
Yeah. Then maybe
it would've been a good idea

740
00:39:03.064 --> 00:39:04.766
to get the right authority
in the first place.

741
00:39:04.790 --> 00:39:06.965
wouldn't you say?

742
00:39:06.999 --> 00:39:08.760
The error in assigning the wrong

743
00:39:08.794 --> 00:39:10.555
surveillance authority
was committed

744
00:39:10.589 --> 00:39:12.108
by a senior officer.

745
00:39:14.110 --> 00:39:15.456
That isn't in the file.

746
00:39:16.837 --> 00:39:18.528
I chose not to embarrass him.

747
00:39:20.150 --> 00:39:24.016
Now look. DCI Davidson.
we are charged here

748
00:39:24.051 --> 00:39:26.053
with investigating
serious crimes.

749
00:39:26.087 --> 00:39:28.089
not least the murder
of a young woman

750
00:39:28.124 --> 00:39:30.437
in the prime of her life.

751
00:39:30.471 --> 00:39:32.853
and I expect
all policemen and women

752
00:39:32.887 --> 00:39:34.544
to uphold their duty
to the public

753
00:39:34.579 --> 00:39:37.547
above any misguided loyalty
they may have

754
00:39:37.582 --> 00:39:39.515
to their fellow officers.

755
00:39:39.549 --> 00:39:41.965
Now who was the senior officer?

756
00:39:44.002 --> 00:39:45.624
No comment. sir.

757
00:39:47.937 --> 00:39:51.734
DI Arnott will you bookmark
that for the DIR:

758
00:39:51.768 --> 00:39:53.460
failure to comply.

759
00:39:53.494 --> 00:39:54.564
Sir.

760
00:40:00.156 --> 00:40:01.537
DC Bishop.

761
00:40:02.676 --> 00:40:04.540
Image 29 on screen.

762
00:40:04.574 --> 00:40:07.266
Please refer to Document 15
in your folders.

763
00:40:07.301 --> 00:40:09.441
a copy of an arrest report
lawfully seized

764
00:40:09.476 --> 00:40:11.029
on the 4th of November.

765
00:40:11.063 --> 00:40:13.238
Said arrest report
describes the arrest

766
00:40:13.272 --> 00:40:17.276
on the 27th of October
-at flat 4
-F. Beechwood House

767
00:40:17.311 --> 00:40:20.038
of a person later
identified as Terry Boyle.

768
00:40:20.072 --> 00:40:22.074
shown on the right in Image 29.

769
