Wait.

1025
00:50:12.526 --> 00:50:15.115
An OCG needed time
to plan the robbery

1026
00:50:15.150 --> 00:50:16.841
and the abduction of Banks.

1027
00:50:16.875 --> 00:50:18.429
If I was SIO on this.

1028
00:50:18.463 --> 00:50:20.096
the first thing
I'd want to know is who knew

1029
00:50:20.120 --> 00:50:22.571
about Banks's confession
early enough.

1030
00:50:22.605 --> 00:50:25.263
In order.
that's the CHIS Handler.

1031
00:50:25.298 --> 00:50:27.300
then my officers
who received his call.

1032
00:50:27.334 --> 00:50:31.304
PS Jatri and DS Lomax.
then me. then my boss.

1033
00:50:31.338 --> 00:50:33.409
Detective Superintendent
Buckells.

1034
00:50:34.617 --> 00:50:36.343
If you're going to search
my home.

1035
00:50:36.378 --> 00:50:38.552
I'd suggest
you search theirs too.

1036
00:50:57.675 --> 00:50:59.894
Do you understand
how much work I've got to do?

1037
00:50:59.918 --> 00:51:02.300
Right. when the Chief Super
phones up and asks

1038
00:51:02.335 --> 00:51:03.829
what's going on
with Lighthouse. right.

1039
00:51:03.853 --> 00:51:05.728
- what am I gonna tell him?
- Cheers guys.

1040
00:51:05.752 --> 00:51:07.616
Oh. about bloody time.

1041
00:51:07.650 --> 00:51:09.318
You gonna tell me
what the hell's going on?

1042
00:51:09.342 --> 00:51:10.733
Detective
Superintendent Buckells.

1043
00:51:10.757 --> 00:51:12.379
in connection
with our lawful inquiry

1044
00:51:12.414 --> 00:51:14.461
into Operation Lighthouse.
we have received authority

1045
00:51:14.485 --> 00:51:15.945
to examine
the communications activity

1046
00:51:15.969 --> 00:51:17.591
of certain named officers.

1047
00:51:17.626 --> 00:51:19.800
- Is this a piss-take or what?
- Sir. your work

1048
00:51:19.835 --> 00:51:21.354
and personal communications
records

1049
00:51:21.388 --> 00:51:22.872
are currently being scrutinised.

1050
00:51:22.907 --> 00:51:24.598
Furthermore.
we have received authority

1051
00:51:24.633 --> 00:51:26.255
to carry out a search
of your vehicle

1052
00:51:26.290 --> 00:51:28.154
and your home
under warrant powers.

1053
00:51:30.501 --> 00:51:32.434
This is a joke.

1054
00:51:32.468 --> 00:51:34.091
a total pigging joke.

1055
00:51:35.264 --> 00:51:36.748
Well. yeah. I'll tell you what.

1056
00:51:36.783 --> 00:51:38.543
when you find my stash
of jazz mags.

1057
00:51:38.578 --> 00:51:40.511
feel free to knock one out.

1058
00:51:40.545 --> 00:51:42.409
Thank you
for your cooperation. sir.

1059
00:51:58.529 --> 00:51:59.737
DI Arnott.

1060
00:51:59.771 --> 00:52:02.222
It's Chloe. sir.

1061
00:52:02.257 --> 00:52:03.820
Look. I'm at the search
and the FIs have found

1062
00:52:03.844 --> 00:52:05.191
a cache of burner phones.

1063
00:52:05.225 --> 00:52:06.640
Where? Davidson's?

1064
00:52:06.675 --> 00:52:08.401
No. Officer J.'s.

1065
00:52:09.333 --> 00:52:10.472
At Farida's.

1066
00:52:11.749 --> 00:52:12.922
On my way.

1067
00:52:21.207 --> 00:52:23.347
For the DIR.
I am showing PS Jatri

1068
00:52:23.381 --> 00:52:25.314
item reference CB-4.

1069
00:52:25.349 --> 00:52:27.903
CB-4 is an unregistered
mobile phone detected

1070
00:52:27.937 --> 00:52:31.872
during a lawful search
of 29 Stalton Drive.

1071
00:52:31.907 --> 00:52:33.495
Do you recognise this phone?

1072
00:52:33.529 --> 00:52:34.634
No!

1073
00:52:36.670 --> 00:52:40.536
For the DIR. I am showing
PS Jatri Image 76.

1074
00:52:40.571 --> 00:52:43.746
Image 76 shows a cache
of similar devices detected

1075
00:52:43.781 --> 00:52:46.784
during said lawful search
of 29 Stalton Drive.

1076
00:52:46.818 --> 00:52:48.589
How do you account
for these devices being found

1077
00:52:48.613 --> 00:52:50.384
- hidden in your home?
- They've been put there!

1078
00:52:50.408 --> 00:52:51.661
I don't know anything
about them!

1079
00:52:51.685 --> 00:52:53.653
All these devices
bear DNA deposits

1080
00:52:53.687 --> 00:52:55.241
matching your elimination samples.

1081
00:52:55.275 --> 00:52:56.555
I've never even seen them before

1082
00:52:56.587 --> 00:52:57.933
let alone touched them!

1083
00:52:57.967 --> 00:53:00.867
Examination of mobile phone CB-4

1084
00:53:00.901 --> 00:53:02.938
reveals calls
made in the early hours

1085
00:53:02.972 --> 00:53:06.976
of October 27th
to an unidentified number.

1086
00:53:07.011 --> 00:53:09.634
The timing of these calls
coincides exactly

1087
00:53:09.669 --> 00:53:11.257
with the first
intelligence report

1088
00:53:11.291 --> 00:53:15.295
of a suspect claiming
to have murdered Gail Vella.

1089
00:53:15.330 --> 00:53:17.332
Did you pass
on confidential information

1090
00:53:17.366 --> 00:53:18.757
on the operation
to arrest this suspect?

1091
00:53:18.781 --> 00:53:20.024
No! No!

1092
00:53:20.058 --> 00:53:21.853
I had nothing to do with it!

1093
00:53:24.097 --> 00:53:26.962
Farida Jatri.
I have been in consultation

1094
00:53:26.996 --> 00:53:29.275
with the Crown Prosecutor
and she has authorised me

1095
00:53:29.309 --> 00:53:31.011
to charge you
with the following offences...

1096
00:53:31.035 --> 00:53:33.520
- I'm being framed!
- Who's framing you?

1097
00:53:35.108 --> 00:53:37.593
Who are you claiming
is framing you?

1098
00:53:40.665 --> 00:53:43.634
It's Jo. It's Jo Davidson.

1099
00:53:43.668 --> 00:53:45.083
She planted those phones.

1100
00:53:45.118 --> 00:53:47.224
You're claiming
she broke into your house?

1101
00:53:48.811 --> 00:53:51.331
She didn't have to break in.

1102
00:53:51.366 --> 00:53:52.608
What do you mean by that?

1103
00:53:54.921 --> 00:53:56.716
She lived there with me.

1104
00:53:58.752 --> 00:54:00.892
We searched
DCI Davidson's home address.

1105
00:54:00.927 --> 00:54:02.549
- It appears lived in.
- Yeah.

1106
00:54:02.584 --> 00:54:03.940
she has her own place.
She just kept

1107
00:54:03.964 --> 00:54:06.001
- overnight stuff at mine.
- We found no items

1108
00:54:06.035 --> 00:54:07.761
belonging to another person.

1109
00:54:07.796 --> 00:54:09.280
She moved out.

1110
00:54:14.043 --> 00:54:16.356
Are you able to disclose to us

1111
00:54:16.391 --> 00:54:18.427
the nature of this relationship?

1112
00:54:25.710 --> 00:54:27.367
She was lying to me.

1113
00:54:28.541 --> 00:54:31.371
She lied and lied.

1114
00:54:31.406 --> 00:54:33.339
That's the kind
of person she is.

1115
00:54:33.373 --> 00:54:34.754
None of you know
what she's like...

1116
00:54:45.005 --> 00:54:47.353
God give me strength.
I don't know who to believe.

1117
00:54:47.387 --> 00:54:48.709
Well. now it seems
possible Farida

1118
00:54:48.733 --> 00:54:49.952
made allegations about Davidson

1119
00:54:49.976 --> 00:54:51.495
for personal reasons.

1120
00:54:51.529 --> 00:54:52.782
But the stuff we've found
since then...

1121
00:54:52.806 --> 00:54:54.463
Isn't enough.

1122
00:54:54.498 --> 00:54:58.398
Not yet anyway.

1123
00:54:58.433 --> 00:54:59.572
<i>Custody.</i>

1124
00:54:59.606 --> 00:55:01.021
Superintendent Hastings.

1125
00:55:01.056 --> 00:55:03.955
<i>- Sir.
- Release DCI Davidson.</i>

1126
00:55:03.990 --> 00:55:05.129
<i>Sir.</i>

1127
00:55:11.031 --> 00:55:13.137
FARIDA Why won't anyone
believe me?

1128
00:55:29.049 --> 00:55:31.051
Thanks. I'm fine from here.

1129
00:55:31.086 --> 00:55:32.467
Ma'am.

1130
00:55:48.586 --> 00:55:50.519
Where to. ma'am?

1131
00:55:50.554 --> 00:55:52.418
I need to pick up my car.

1132
00:55:53.798 --> 00:55:54.948
I don't know if they've told you

1133
00:55:54.972 --> 00:55:56.767
about PS Jatri...

1134
00:55:56.801 --> 00:55:58.941
That's what happens to a rat.

1135
00:55:58.965 --> 00:56:00.965
